## S1. Sign-up (onboarding gate, light)

**Status:** EXISTING, ALTER | **Priority:** P0 | **PRD:** AUTH-1, AUTH-2, AUTH-4

**Goal:** the shortest path from opening the app to the dashboard: two inputs, one OTP, one checkbox.

**Keep as is:** screen layout, visual style, branding, transition into Home.

**Add / change:**

| Element | Behaviour |
| --- | --- |
| Mobile number | 10-digit Indian mobile (starts 6-9) |
| OTP | Mock OTP `123456`; 3 attempts, 30 s resend timer, lockout message after 3 failures |
| Name | Required, letters and spaces |
| Terms and privacy | **One** un-ticked checkbox: "I agree to the Terms and have read the Privacy Notice". Notice link opens a simple static modal/page. Continue is disabled until ticked |
