## S7. Step 5: Applicant & KYC

**Status:** NEW | **Priority:** P0 | **PRD:** APP-0..2, KYC-1..4

Single step with collapsible sections in the existing form style.

### 7-0. PAN and consents (first thing in this step)

This is the first point where PAN and consent are requested, because this is where the data is first needed.

| Element | Behaviour |
| --- | --- |
| PAN | Regex `^[A-Z]{5}[0-9]{4}[A-Z]$`, 4th character `P`, auto-uppercase. Mocked verify returns Match / Partial / Mismatch. Mismatch offers a correction path (borrower confirms the PAN name replaces the sign-up name). Masked after entry. The mock PAN selects the demo persona (see §3) |
| Consents | Three **separate, un-ticked** checkboxes: (a) KYC, (b) credit bureau check, (c) processing personal data for this application. Purpose stated for each. Logged with ID, version, timestamp and application reference |
| Per application | Bureau consent is asked again for each new application. It is not silently reused |
| Decline | If a consent is declined, a message explains what cannot proceed, the draft is kept, and the borrower returns to S2. Data from Steps 1-4 is not lost |
| Drop-off (P1) | Pre-fill name and mobile, save per section, short "what we need and why" summary |

The rest of this step (7a to 7d) unlocks after PAN is verified and consents (a) to (c) are ticked.

### 7a. Personal and financial profile

| Field | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| DOB | Age gate: ≥ 21 at application; ≤ 65 (salaried) / 70 (self-employed) at maturity (config) |
| Employment type | Salaried / Self-employed |
| Employer / business name | Text |
| Net monthly income | Currency |
| Existing monthly EMIs | Currency |
| Residence type, address, pincode | Select / text / 6-digit |
| Email | Format-validated |
| Name | Pre-filled from PAN verification, read-only |

### 7b. KYC

- **Aadhaar e-KYC / DigiLocker (mock):** consent → OTP → returns name, DOB, address, masked Aadhaar (last 4 only). (P0)
- **CKYC lookup (mock):** if found, skip re-collection. (P0)
- **Selfie / video KYC (mock):** P2.

### 7c. Bank account

Account number, IFSC, account-holder name (mock name match). Used for the mandate and refunds.

### 7d. Documents (P1)

Mock upload with state: uploaded · verifying · accepted · rejected ("blurred" reason). Income proof (all), RC copy (used), quotation (new).

**Validation on Continue:** re-check age/tenure caps. If tenure now exceeds the age-at-maturity limit, prompt to go back to S6 and reduce tenure. **Data out:** `pan {masked, verified, nameMatch}`, `consents[{id, purpose, version, timestamp, applicationRef}]`, `applicant {...}`, `kyc {status, method, aadhaarLast4}`, `bank {...}`. **Mock services:** `kycService`, `ckycService`, `bankVerifyService`, `docService`.

